# Local development only: `npm run dev` reads .env and .env.local. In production the key is a Worker
# secret (`npx wrangler secret put TYPESAFE_API_KEY`) and the settings live in wrangler.jsonc.
# One key is enough. With both set TypeSafe is used; JEV_PROVIDER=openrouter switches over.
# TypeSafe's own API: https://typesafe.ai
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=
# OpenRouter's Decisions API: https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
